Package: MacroPhyloMaker
Title: Tools for Extracting, Grafting, and Assembling Large Phylogenies
Version: 2026.09.01
Authors@R: 
    person("Marek", "Borowiec", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "marek.borowiec@colostate.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7510-4064"))
Description: Provides tools to extract cleaned subtrees with outgroups, 
    graft tips and trees into ultrametric backbone chronograms 
    (including stem-aware chronos-based rescaling), fill genus-level tips
    with species-level names using taxonomy reference, convert taxonomy 
    tables to TACT taxonomy format, and generate autosized or paginated 
    PDF plots of large phylogenies.
